    <h1 class="visually-hidden">Atomdrift</h1>
    <h2>About</h2>
    <p>
Atomdrift is building the next generation of open-source malware and supply-chain attack
detection tools. Our mission is to build offline, local-first tools that detect even
subtle supply-chain attacks such as the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XZ_Utils_backdoor">XZ Utils backdoor</a>.
</p>

<p><a href="/scan">Atomdrift Scan</a> detects more zero-day malware than any scanner we benchmark, open-source or commercial: <a href="/compare/">see Compare</a>.
Everything is <a href="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0">Apache 2.0</a>, built to integrate into any pipeline or product, and supports any platform you need to secure, from MacBooks to Windows PCs to IBM mainframes.</p>

